# Hero image — no compression

- **`client/public/hero-bg-gateway.png`** is the home page hero background. It is served as a static file with **no build-time or automated compression**.
- Do **not** run this file through image optimization, WebP conversion, or "98% reduction" pipelines. The platform standard for asset economy does **not** apply to this asset; clarity is required.
- When replacing the hero image, the user should place a high-quality PNG or JPEG at `client/public/hero-bg-gateway.png`; it will be served unchanged.
